Skip changelog: CI/test-infrastructure only. Adds source/isaaclab_tasks/test/test_cartpole_training_smoke.py covering two-iter rsl_rl PPO training on Isaac-Cartpole-Direct-v0 (state) and Isaac-Cartpole-RGB-Camera-Direct-v0 (perception), tagged pytest.mark.arm_ci so the ARM/Spark workflow picks them up via the CI_MARKER orchestrator. Mirrors the subprocess pattern from test_train_scripts_deterministic.py with --max_iterations=2 --num_envs=16.
